
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Listar concesiones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Consultar una concesión
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Conceder un recurso a un rol
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role_id": 2,
  "resource_id": 7
}

### Revocar concesión
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reactivar concesión
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/1/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 401 — sin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol
